{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42659","headline":"秋日圃田送人随计 · 谭用之","name":"秋日圃田送人随计","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆射陂前是传邮，去程鵰鹗弄高秋。\n吟抛芍药裁诗圃，醉下茱萸饮酒楼。\n向日迥飞驹皎皎，临风谁和鹿呦呦。\n明年二月仙山下，莫遣桃花逐水流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谭用之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}